"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For an earlier Bangkok arrival, I’d investigate the January 15 Aeroplan itinerary via Hong Kong first. It reaches Bangkok the evening of January 16, with a reported 70-minute HKG connection and 9 seats. The award is reported as economy, but the individual leg cabins are unspecified.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J8@2027-01-15T11:45-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-16T22:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arrival Aeroplan award\",\"v\":\"The tradeoff is leaving San Francisco earlier than the later-departing alternative. It reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 107.40 in taxes/fees; both amounts have unknown price scope, so they are not an all-in or per-traveler total.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T17\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T18\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If you prefer a later departure, the other Hong Kong option arrives the next morning. It reports the same points, taxes/fees and seat count, and its elapsed journey is only 5 minutes shorter—so that small duration difference may not outweigh the earlier arrival of the option above.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J14@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T09:50\",\"n\":\"Later-departing Aeroplan award\",\"v\":\"This option also reports 9 seats, a 70-minute HKG connection, 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 107.40 in taxes/fees, with unknown price scope. Its award is reported as economy; individual leg cabins are unspecified.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For cash context, the search returned a USD 456 SFO–BKK itinerary with two stops on United and ANA. Its price scope is unknown, so treat it only as a baseline—not a per-traveler or all-in comparison with the awards.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C3@2027-01-15T08:51-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline\",\"v\":\"Returned cash quote; scope unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Search results may not be real-time, and provider coverage was partial, with some routes and dates omitted. Confirm current availability and prices before booking. The reported HKG waits are connections within the award itineraries; they do not establish connection protection or current bookability.\"}]}"
